{"type":"text","timestamp":1788149478209,"sessionID":"ses_fa9fcdc17ffeRVauzqNiDdha0L","part":{"id":"prt_05603b0690015KA4Pjd6TpThk6","messageID":"msg_056038645001fbq370dhtfCfbw","sessionID":"ses_fa9fcdc17ffeRVauzqNiDdha0L","type":"text","text":"The visible tests confirm the target shape and legacy aliases. I’ll implement strict path-aware validation, deep-copy/idempotent v2 handling, filtered unknown metadata, batch error aggregation, audit generation, and JSONL CLI behavior in the single permitted file.","time":{"start":1788149477481,"end":1788149478203},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_01a10c7a3579e65f016a94fee567cc87d2b454c0ecb45e155d","phase":"commentary"}}}}
